 controls=slider('noise-threshold','Log a loud sound above',70,20,100)+`<p class="storage-note">Relative loudness varies with microphone gain. This is not a calibrated sound meter (dB SPL).</p>`;steps=['Allow microphone access when you start.','Watch the live level and adjust the threshold.','Only numbers and peak events are saved. Audio never leaves memory.'];
